hor":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>to a stock. 10:8; Ps 115:4-8; Isa 44:9-20; 46:6-8; Hab 2:18,19 brought me forth. or, begotten me. for they. Eze 8:16; 23:35 their back. Heb. the hinder part of the neck. but in thetime. 24; 22:23; Jud 10:8-16; Ps 78:34-37; Isa 26:16; Ho 5:15; 7:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-2-28","title":"Jeremiah 2:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>But where. De 32:37; Jud 10:14; 2Ki 3:13; Isa 45:20; 46:2,7 trouble. Heb. evil. to the number. 11:13; 2Ki 17:30,31; Ho 10:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-2-29","title":"Jeremiah 2:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>will ye plead. 23,35; 3:2 ye all have. 5:1; 6:13; 9:2-6; Da 9:11; Ro 3:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-2-30","title":"Jeremiah 2:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>In vain. 5:3; 6:29,30; 7:28; 31:18; 2Ch 28:22; Isa 1:5; 9:13; Eze 24:13 Zep 3:2; Re 9:20,21; 16:9 your own sword. 26:20-24; 1Ki 19:10,14; 2Ch 24:21; 36:16; Ne 9:26; Mt 21:35,36 Mt 23:29,34-37; Mr 12:2-8; Lu 11:47-51; 13:33,34; Ac 7:52 1Th 2:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-2-31","title":"Jeremiah 2:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>see ye. Am 1:1; Mic 6:9 Have I been. 5,6; 2Sa 12:7-9; 2Ch 31:10; Ne 9:21-25; Ho 2:7,8; Mal 3:9-11 We are lords. Heb. We have dominion. De 8:12-14; 31:20; 32:15; Ps 10:4; 12:4; Pr 30:9; Ho 13:6; 1Co 4:8 Re 3:15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-2-32","title":"Jeremiah 2:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>a maid. 11; Ge 24:22,30,53; 2S